Read Contention 
- SERIALIZABLE - strong isolation than read commited 
- Pessimistic locking - select and update in one transaction , deadlock with pessimistic locking chances - singleDatbase+High contention
- Optimstic locking - version update , during update set version = version+1 - singleDatbase+ low contention
- two phase commit   - commit when both are prepared to commit - multiple database + tolerate eventual consistency
- Distributed locks- Redis with TTL , zookeeper etc/etd,Database columns  
- Saga Pattern - compensation steps work after any of the process fails- multiple database + No tolerate eventual consistency


